intro:
  heading: "Commercial Asphalt Sealcoating & Pavement Maintenance"
  paragraphs:
    - >
      S. Phaneuf & Associates provides professional commercial parking lot sealcoating, hot-pour rubberized crack filling, and high-visibility traffic line striping for commercial properties across Massachusetts. Regular sealcoating every 2 to 3 years prevents asphalt oxidation, oil penetration, and water intrusion caused by New England winter de-icing salts.
    - >
      We apply commercial-grade heavy-duty asphalt sealers using spray and squeegee application techniques to replenish essential binder oils, restoring dark asphalt appearance and dramatically extending pavement service life.
    - >
      Our crew completes line striping for parking bays, fire lanes, directional arrows, and ADA handicap stalls to maintain full regulatory compliance for your business.

